    "name": "Vidya API",
    "description": "# Vidya API (student, `/api/v1`)\n\nLocal: `http://localhost:4000` or your LAN IP from `npm start`.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set `studentPassword` from the seed (`StudentDemo1!`) — **do not commit secrets**.\n2. Run **Auth → login** — `studentToken` / `refreshToken` auto-save.\n3. Set `chapterId`, `sectionId`, `classId`, `subjectId`, `schoolId`, `notificationId` from list responses\n   (seed examples below).\n4. After editing YAML, run `npm run postman:export`.\n\n## Surface\nHealth, Auth, Students (onboarding, profile, avatar, settings, progress, bookmarks),\nSchools, Curriculum, Notifications.\n\n## Docs\n- Swagger UI: `{{baseUrl}}/docs`\n- OpenAPI JSON: `{{baseUrl}}/docs-json`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
